Step 1: Download VS Code

Go to the official Visual Studio Code website and download the Windows version.

Step 2: Install
Open the downloaded installer.
Accept the agreement.
Click Next.
Select installation options.
Click Install.
Open VS Code.
Step 3: Create a Project

Create a folder:WebDevelopment
WebDevelopment
│
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── script.js

